#: ../../source/.github_INCIDENT_RESPONSE_PROCESS.md:3
msgid "Reporting a Vulnerability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/.github_INCIDENT_RESPONSE_PROCESS.md:5
msgid ""
"We take the security of **resolve** very seriously. If you believe you’ve"
" found a security vulnerability, please inform us responsibly through "
"coordinated disclosure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/.github_INCIDENT_RESPONSE_PROCESS.md:7
msgid "How to Report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/.github_INCIDENT_RESPONSE_PROCESS.md:9
msgid ""
"**Do not** report security vulnerabilities through public GitHub issues, "
"discussions, or social media."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/.github_INCIDENT_RESPONSE_PROCESS.md:11
msgid "Instead, please use one of these secure channels:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/.github_INCIDENT_RESPONSE_PROCESS.md:13
msgid ""
"**GitHub Security Advisories** Use the **Report a vulnerability** button "
"in the Security tab of the [browserify/resolve "
"repository](https://github.com/browserify/resolve)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/.github_INCIDENT_RESPONSE_PROCESS.md:16
msgid ""
"**Email** Follow the posted [Security "
"Policy](https://github.com/browserify/resolve/security/policy)."
msgstr ""

